<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-marble="1">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="marble:capabilities" content="storage; net=none">
<title>__TITLE__</title>
<style>
  /* The Marble design system's palette, with one change the system does not
     make: a document is white to the edge. The off-white paper belongs to
     the interface — the Drive itself — not to the thing you are writing in.
     One dusty blue does all the accenting, the same blue in every starter,
     because five colours would be five claims and there is only one. */
  :root {
    --ink: #111111;
    --muted: #5a5a5a;
    --line: #ddd9cf;
    --paper: #ffffff;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --accent: #9bb6cf;
    --accent-soft: #f1f5f8;
    --accent-ink: #738698;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --ink: #e8e6e1; --muted: #a3a7ab; --line: #2f3438;
      --paper: #1c1f22; --card: #1c1f22;
      --accent: #7fa8c9; --accent-soft: #1d2932; --accent-ink: #9dc0dc;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 6rem; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    font: 15px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 .2rem; letter-spacing: -.015em; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 1.5rem; font-size: .95rem; }

  .cols { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start; overflow-x: auto; padding: 0 0 1rem 1.6rem; }
  .col { flex: 0 0 17rem; }
  .col-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .5rem; padding: 0 .25rem .5rem; }
  .col-head h2 { font-size: .95rem; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -.005em; }
  /* How many cards is a count of elements, so it is counted rather than kept. */
  .cards { counter-reset: card; }
  .card { counter-increment: card; }
  .col-head .n { font: 600 .7rem/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; color: var(--muted); }

  .cards {
    list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: .25rem; min-height: 4rem;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 35%, transparent); border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px;
    padding: .6rem .7rem; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
  }
  .card h3 { font-size: .88rem; margin: 0 0 .2rem; line-height: 1.35; }
  .card p { margin: 0; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.45; }
  [data-marble-editable] { outline: none; border-radius: 3px; }
  [data-marble-editable]:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); }
  [data-marble-editable]:focus { background: var(--card); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--accent), 0 0 0 4px var(--accent-soft); }
  .add {
    appearance: none; width: 100%; margin-top: .5rem; padding: .45rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: none;
    color: var(--muted); font: 500 .82rem/1 inherit; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .add:hover { color: var(--accent-ink); border-color: var(--accent); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main data-marble-id="__ID__">

  <h1 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>__TITLE__</h1>
  <p class="lede" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>A card’s column is the column it sits in and nothing else. Drag one across and you have moved it in the file.</p>

  <div class="cols" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-sortable="cols">

    <section class="col" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-removable>
      <header class="col-head" data-marble-id="__ID__">
        <h2 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>To do</h2>
      </header>
      <ol class="cards" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-sortable="cards">
        <li class="card" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-removable>
          <h3 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>Something to do</h3>
          <p data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>And a line about what it means.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <button class="add" data-marble-transient data-marble-add="#tpl-card" data-marble-into="prev">+ card</button>
    </section>

    <section class="col" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-removable>
      <header class="col-head" data-marble-id="__ID__">
        <h2 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>Doing</h2>
      </header>
      <ol class="cards" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-sortable="cards">
        <li class="card" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-removable>
          <h3 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>Something in flight</h3>
          <p data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>Drag it right when it is finished.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <button class="add" data-marble-transient data-marble-add="#tpl-card" data-marble-into="prev">+ card</button>
    </section>

    <section class="col" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-removable>
      <header class="col-head" data-marble-id="__ID__">
        <h2 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>Done</h2>
      </header>
      <ol class="cards" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-sortable="cards"></ol>
      <button class="add" data-marble-transient data-marble-add="#tpl-card" data-marble-into="prev">+ card</button>
    </section>

  </div>

</main>

<template id="tpl-card" data-marble-transient>
  <li class="card" data-marble-removable>
    <h3 data-marble-editable>New card</h3>
    <p data-marble-editable>What it is.</p>
  </li>
</template>

__SCRIPT__
</body>
</html>
